---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../components/Eyebrow.astro";

const updated = "May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How elefox studio collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us."
>
  <section class="pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-10">
    <Container size="default">
      <Eyebrow>Legal</Eyebrow>
      <h1 class="mt-6 display-xl text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)]">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-6">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <Container size="default">
      <div class="prose-legal max-w-2xl space-y-10 text-graphite leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          elefox studio is a brand of Tiffany Russell Studio LLC ("elefox
          studio," "we," "us," or "our"). This policy explains what
          information we collect through elefoxstudio.com, how we use it, and
          the choices you have. We keep it short and plain on purpose.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Information you give us</h2>
          <p>
            When you fill out a form on our site, book a call, or email us, we
            collect what you choose to share: your name, email address, phone
            number, business details, and anything you write in the message.
            We use it to respond to you and, if we work together, to provide
            our services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Information collected automatically</h2>
          <p>
            Like most websites, we automatically collect basic technical
            information when you visit: pages viewed, the site you came from,
            and general device and browser details. This is gathered through
            cookies and similar technologies, described below.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Cookies and analytics</h2>
          <p>We use a small number of third-party services to run and improve the site:</p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
            <li><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Google Analytics 4</strong>, to understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Google Ads</strong>, to measure whether our ads lead to inquiries.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Cloudflare</strong>, for security and privacy-friendly traffic measurement.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Cloudflare Turnstile</strong>, to protect our forms from spam and bots.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            These services set cookies or use similar identifiers. You can
            block or delete cookies in your browser settings, and you can opt
            out of Google Analytics using Google's
            <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ember">browser add-on</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">How we use your information</h2>
          <p>
            To respond to your inquiries, provide and improve our services,
            understand how the site performs, and measure our advertising. We
            do not sell your personal information.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">How we share it</h2>
          <p>
            We share information only with the service providers that help us
            operate, such as Google (analytics and ads), Cloudflare (security
            and hosting support), Resend (email delivery), and Railway
            (hosting). They process it on our behalf and are not permitted to
            use it for their own purposes. We may also disclose information if
            required by law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Data retention</h2>
          <p>
            We keep the information you send us for as long as needed to
            respond and, where relevant, to maintain our business records.
            You can ask us to delete it at any time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Your choices</h2>
          <p>
            You can ask us what information we hold about you, request a
            correction, or ask us to delete it. Just email
            <a href="mailto:hello@elefoxstudio.com" class="text-forest underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ember">hello@elefoxstudio.com</a>.
            Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under
            your local privacy laws, and we will honor those requests.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Security</h2>
          <p>
            We use reasonable measures to protect your information, including
            encrypted connections and reputable hosting providers. No method
            of transmission over the internet is completely secure, so we
            cannot guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Children</h2>
          <p>
            Our site is meant for businesses and is not directed to children
            under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will
            change the "last updated" date above.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Contact us</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about this policy or your information? Reach us at:
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Tiffany Russell Studio LLC (elefox studio)<br />
            Coral Springs, FL<br />
            <a href="mailto:hello@elefoxstudio.com" class="text-forest underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ember">hello@elefoxstudio.com</a><br />
            <a href="tel:+19547806508" class="text-forest underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ember">954.780.6508</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
